  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Sea Bath Salt Shining Star, 250 g</strong><br/>\r\nBring on the shine and elevate your skin with the Sea Bath Salt Shining Star.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Built-in silver, shimmering glitters deliver a radiant, delicate shimmer to your skin.</li>\n<li>A delicate fragrance leaves a beautiful scent trail on the body. Top notes unfold instantly with gentle blackcurrant, rose, geranium, pink pepper, jasmine; heart notes – freesia and lily, enriched with plum and vibrant musk; base notes – with the aroma of hard candy, oakmoss, sandalwood, and mellow amber.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br/>\n<strong>The formula enriched with natural oils provides the body with extra care.</strong><br/>\n<strong>Macadamia oil</strong> protects the skin from harsh weather conditions, helping it stay deeply hydrated. Rich in saturated and unsaturated fatty acids, as well as vitamins PP and B-complex vitamins, it significantly improves the condition of problem skin, offers a soothing effect, eliminates dryness and flaking, and delivers powerful regenerating, moisturizing, and softening benefits. Packed with antioxidant properties, it slows down the aging process and regulates the water-lipid balance, which in turn promotes skin rejuvenation, boosts elasticity, and reduces the appearance of wrinkles. <strong>Coconut oil</strong> deeply nourishes and gives the skin a captivating look. The acids (pantothenic, folic, caprylic, and others) and vitamins B1 and C contained in the oil help preserve youth and beauty.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
