 deeply hydrated. Rich in saturated and unsaturated fatty acids, as well as vitamins PP and B-complex vitamins, it significantly improves the condition of problem skin, offers a soothing effect, eliminates dryness and flaking, and delivers powerful regenerating, moisturizing, and softening benefits. Packed with antioxidant properties, it slows down the aging process and regulates the water-lipid balance, which in turn promotes skin rejuvenation, boosts elasticity, and reduces the appearance of wrinkles. <strong>Coconut oil</strong> deeply nourishes and gives the skin a captivating look. The acids (pantothenic, folic, caprylic, and others) and vitamins B1 and C contained in the oil help preserve youth and beauty.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uidfda6a51f8b56c085838a05d2321fb715\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uidfda6a51f8b56c085838a05d2321fb715\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"560ebbef7b656014b0616f275de09b33\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-pr